    "raw_content": "WTO | Global Trade Outlook and Statistics - April 2025\n\nWORLD TRADE ORGANIZATION\nHome  |  About WTO  |  News & events  |  Trade topics  |  WTO membership  |  Documents & resources  |  External relations\nContact us  |  Site map  |  A-Z  |  Search\n\n \n\nespañol  français\n\nhomedocuments, data and resourcespublicationsglobal trade outlook and statistics\n\npublications\nGlobal Trade Outlook and Statistics\nApril 2025\nThe WTO’s “Global Trade  Outlook and Statistics” presents the WTO Secretariat's forecasts for world  trade in 2025 and 2026. Breakdowns of merchandise and commercial services trade  by sector and region are provided, together with details on leading traders. \n\nAn  analytical chapter discusses the economic effects of trade policy uncertainty.  The report is timed to coincide with the release of the WTO’s latest quarterly  and annual trade statistics, which can be downloaded from the WTO’s online  database at stats.wto.org. \nPublished in 2025.\nDownload PDF\nDownload data\n\nAll charts and tables\n\nShare\n\n  \n\n \nDownload full publication\nDownload \n\nSee news item\nNews item \n\nDownload data\n\nAll charts and tables\n\nProblems viewing this page? If so, please contact [email protected] giving details of the operating system and web browser you are using.",
